{"5024900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BAIKAL LICKING SIMULATOR", "steam_appid": 5024900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An amazing immersive simulator that transports you to a small town on the shores of Lake Baikal, where you can express your love for the greatest, coolest, and freshest lake on Earth — Baikal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How exactly? The answer is obvious: lick it, and then lick it again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5024900/extras/5618b220d9a908a93d6459d7a7651376.poster.avif?t=1785826536\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5024900/extras/5618b220d9a908a93d6459d7a7651376.webm?t=1785826536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5024900/extras/5618b220d9a908a93d6459d7a7651376.mp4?t=1785826536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Baikal isn’t the only thing that needs your attention — complete quests and unlock achievements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move at the speed of sound as you search for hidden Easter eggs and hilarious moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5024900/extras/3e579014b3781a721b58590e58b90dcc.poster.avif?t=1785826536\" width=1138 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5024900/extras/3e579014b3781a721b58590e58b90dcc.webm?t=1785826536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5024900/extras/3e579014b3781a721b58590e58b90dcc.mp4?t=17